      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know what the point is anymore. its just one day after another of the same smells, the same sounds, the same staring at a wall. i feel like im just waiting for him to go so i can finally stop breathing, but i feel like i died months ago anyway. im just a ghost walking around this house.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
